        "text": "#### [MODIFY] [crates/statcraft_app/Cargo.toml](file:///d:/Projects/active/StatCraft/crates/statcraft_app/Cargo.toml)\n* Добавить `statcraft_bridge = { path = \"../statcraft_bridge\" }`."
